      "prompts": [
        {
          "id": "you-can-use-form-8822-to-notify-the-internal-revenue-service-if-you-changed-your-home-mailing-address-if-this-change-also-affects-the-mailing-address-for-your-children-who-filed-income-tax-returns-complete-and-file-a-separate-form-8822-for-each-child-if-you-are-a-representative-signing-for-the-taxpayer-attach-to-form-8822-a-copy-of-your-power-of-attorney-generally-it-takes-4-to-6-weeks-to-process-a-change-of-address",
          "label": "You can use Form 8822 to notify the Internal Revenue Service if you changed your home mailing address. If this change also affects the mailing address for your children who filed income tax returns, complete and file a separate Form 8822 for each child. If you are a representative signing for the ta",
